	<PackageId>NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.Manager</PackageId>
	<Company>NextGen Software Ltd</Company>
	<Product>HoloNET Holochain Manager</Product>
	<Title>HoloNET Holochain Manager</Title>
	<Summary>WPF UI manager for HoloNET Client and HoloNET ORM -- a live demo, dev tool, and reusable component library for building .NET hApps on Holochain 0.6.x.</Summary>
	<Description>HoloNET Manager is a WPF desktop application and reusable component library that showcases every feature of HoloNET Client and HoloNET ORM. Acts as a Launcher, Dev Store, and hApp management console: install/enable/disable/uninstall hApps, manage agents, inspect cells, monitor network stats, browse DHT state, and exercise every ORM CRUD operation -- all with a polished UI. The backend components (ViewModels, services, data-binding helpers) are designed to be reused in your own .NET hApps. Planned ports to Uno, MAUI, and OpenSilver for Windows/Mac/Linux/mobile/web. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp</Description>
	<!---->
	<PackageProjectUrl>https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one</PackageProjectUrl>
